dering timezone for events**\\n\\nI need to clarify the timezone context for events, particularly for tomorrow. I can create a broad list for November 9 in UTC and include possible time offsets. I should check the calendar for the local timezone information, but I can't guess the timezone for any specific event. It’s essential to list options from UTC November 8 to November 11 to determine the relevant timezone and filter later without needing to ask if it includes timezones.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_05f8129b6bf5d9a8016af12b03833087d0a780fa94da913eef\",\"call_id\":\"call_EcCn8su2pszCa0KSzffgaRQv\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"tools run <<'JS'\\\\nconst results = await Promise.all([\\\\n tools.calendar.list({from:\\\\\\\"2026-11-09T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\",to:\\\\\\\"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\",limit:100}),\\\\n tools.mail.read({message:\\\\\\\"msg_18045a14f253441e\\\\\\\"}),\\\\n tools.drive.read({file:\\\\\\\"file_48e244f56ec64da3\\\\\\\"})\\\\n]);\\\\nresults.forEach((r,i)=>console.log(JSON.stringify({kind:[\\\\\\\"calendar\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"mail\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"drive\\\\\\\"][i],result:r})));\\\\nJS\\\",\\\"timeout\\\":null}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_EcCn8su2pszCa0KSzffgaRQv\",\"output\":\"{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"calendar\\\",\\\"result\\\":{\\\"events\\\":[{\\\"event\\\":\\\"evt_e9958e2edbe54752\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Team standup\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T09:00:00Z\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T09:15:00Z\\\",\\\"time_zone\\\":\\\"UTC\\\",\\\"organizer\\\":{\\\"email\\\":\\\"lee@example.test\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Lee Example\\\"},\\\"response\\\":\\\"accepted\\\"},{\\\"event\\\":\\\"evt_a31e29992d564cd5\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Q3 planning review\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T14:00:00Z\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T15:00:00Z\\\",\\\"time_zone\\\":\\\"UTC\\\",\\\"location\\\":\\\"Room 4\\\",\\\"organizer\\\":{\\\"email\\\":\\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dana Example\\\"},\\\"respons